' SD-05. UC-005 삼면 장애물 감지 후 후진
' Related Use Case: UC-005. 삼면 장애물 감지 후 후진
' Intent: 전방, 좌측, 우측이 모두 막힌 상태에서 후방 장애물 여부를 확인하고 후진 또는 정지로 분기하는 흐름을 표현한다.
' Note: 후방 장애물이 없으면 후진하고, 후방 장애물이 있으면 정지 상태를 유지한다.

@startuml SD_05_UC005_Backward_On_Three_Side_Obstacle
title SD-05 - UC-005 삼면 장애물 감지 후 후진

actor "센서 입력" as Sensor
participant "RVC SW Controller" as Controller
participant "SensorState" as SensorState
participant "AutomaticCleaning" as Cleaning
participant "AvoidanceDecision" as AvoidanceDecision
participant "MovementCommand" as MovementCommand
actor "주행 장치" as Drive

alt 후진 가능
    Sensor -> Controller: reportObstacleState(frontObstacleDetected=true, backObstacleDetected=false, leftObstacleDetected=true, rightObstacleDetected=true)
    activate Controller
    Controller -> SensorState: updateObstacles(frontObstacleDetected=true, backObstacleDetected=false, leftObstacleDetected=true, rightObstacleDetected=true)
    Controller -> Cleaning: handleThreeSideObstacle(SensorState)
    activate Cleaning
    Cleaning -> SensorState: isThreeSideBlocked()
    SensorState --> Cleaning: true
    Cleaning -> Cleaning: changeMovementStatus(BLOCKED)
    Cleaning -> MovementCommand: create(STOP)
    MovementCommand --> Cleaning: stopCommand
    Cleaning -> AvoidanceDecision: evaluateBackwardRequired(SensorState)
    AvoidanceDecision --> Cleaning: backwardRequired=true
    Cleaning --> Controller: commandResult(stopCommand)
    Controller -> Drive: stop()
    Cleaning -> SensorState: canMoveBackward()
    SensorState --> Cleaning: true
    Cleaning -> MovementCommand: create(MOVE_BACKWARD)
    MovementCommand --> Cleaning: backwardCommand
    Cleaning --> Controller: commandResult(backwardCommand)
    Controller -> Drive: moveBackward()
    Drive --> Controller: backwardCompleted()
    Sensor -> Controller: reportSideObstacleState(leftObstacleDetected, rightObstacleDetected)
    Controller -> SensorState: updateSideObstacles(leftObstacleDetected, rightObstacleDetected)
    alt 좌측만 이동 가능
        Controller -> Cleaning: selectAvoidanceDirection(SensorState)
        note right of Cleaning: UC-003에서 LEFT 선택
    else 우측만 이동 가능
        Controller -> Cleaning: selectAvoidanceDirection(SensorState)
        note right of Cleaning: UC-003에서 RIGHT 선택
    else 좌측과 우측 모두 이동 가능
        Controller -> Cleaning: selectAvoidanceDirection(SensorState)
        note right of Cleaning: UC-003에서 정책에 따라 선택
    else 좌측과 우측 모두 계속 막힘
        Controller -> Cleaning: handleThreeSideObstacle(SensorState)
        note right of Cleaning: BLOCKED 상태 유지 또는 추가 후진 판단
    end
else 후진 불가 및 좌우 모두 막힘
    Sensor -> Controller: reportObstacleState(frontObstacleDetected=true, backObstacleDetected=true, leftObstacleDetected=true, rightObstacleDetected=true)
    activate Controller
    Controller -> SensorState: updateObstacles(frontObstacleDetected=true, backObstacleDetected=true, leftObstacleDetected=true, rightObstacleDetected=true)
    Controller -> Cleaning: handleThreeSideObstacle(SensorState)
    activate Cleaning
    Cleaning -> SensorState: isThreeSideBlocked()
    SensorState --> Cleaning: true
    Cleaning -> SensorState: canMoveBackward()
    SensorState --> Cleaning: false
    Cleaning -> AvoidanceDecision: markNoAvailableDirection()
    AvoidanceDecision --> Cleaning: availableDirection=false
    Cleaning -> MovementCommand: create(STOP)
    MovementCommand --> Cleaning: stopCommand
    Cleaning -> Cleaning: changeMovementStatus(STOPPED)
    Cleaning --> Controller: commandResult(stopCommand)
    Controller -> Drive: stop()
end

Cleaning --> Controller: threeSideObstacleHandled()
deactivate Cleaning
deactivate Controller
@enduml
